---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Split from '../../components/Split.astro'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Serve | Pine Lake Covenant Church"
  description="Ways to serve at Pine Lake — alongside local partners in the Sammamish and Issaquah area, and on the teams that make Sundays work."
>
  <div class="canvas">
    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="715550230_18207937264338056_8366812198487572303_n.jpg"
      alt="A student carrying groceries for the Issaquah & Sammamish food project"
      tone="sand"
      reverse
      eyebrow="Serve"
    >
      <h1 class="display">Serve</h1>
      <p class="subhead">Ways to help — nearby and on Sundays</p>
      <p class="lede">
        If you’re looking for a way to help, you don’t need to invent something new. There are two simple places to
        start: alongside the local organizations we partner with, or on one of the teams that make Sunday mornings work.
      </p>
    </Split>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="eyebrow">In the community</p>
      <h2>Serve alongside local partners</h2>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Issaquah Food &amp; Clothing Bank</h3>
          <p>Helping stock shelves and serve neighbors facing food insecurity across the Issaquah area.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Bright Bridge</h3>
          <p>Supporting families in the region with practical help in moments of acute need.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Echo Glen</h3>
          <p>Showing up for young people at the Echo Glen Children’s Center through ongoing relationships.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Young Life</h3>
          <p>Coming alongside local students, including Young Life Capernaum for students with disabilities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="eyebrow">On a Sunday</p>
      <h2>Serve on a Sunday team</h2>
      <p class="measure">Sundays come together because people show up to help. A few of the teams you can join:</p>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Hospitality</h3>
          <p>Greeting people, making coffee, and helping everyone feel welcome from the moment they arrive.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Kids &amp; Youth</h3>
          <p>Investing in the next generation by serving alongside our kids and youth programs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Worship &amp; Tech</h3>
          <p>Using musical or technical gifts to help lead worship and run sound, slides, and video.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Getting started</h2>
      <p class="measure">
        You don’t need experience or a long-term commitment to begin — most people start by showing up once with someone
        who’s already involved. To find a good first step, email <a href="mailto:office@plcc.org">office@plcc.org</a> or call
        <a href="tel:+14253928636">(425) 392-8636</a>, and we’ll point you toward what’s coming up.
      </p>
      <p><a href={`${base}for-our-neighbors/`}>← Back to For Our Neighbors</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
